    "turn_idx": 104,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, 2020 was something that no one really anticipated, I don't think. Did this shock you? The speed in which the governments and, you know, not talking about the world, just in America, the governments stepping into control lives overnight. And the American public said, Oh, please tell me what to do. Do I need to clean my hands? And how do I stay healthy? Did that surprise you at the speed of that?",
