    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86346.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 199,
    "turn_text": "You know, there's a few things that you've said in the past that I remember. And one of them was when we were in transition that you would never be the kind of governor that. One re-election by a landslide. And you said the reason for that is because we are going to do big things. And when you do big things, you make people angry and you make enemies. And so rather than sit back and lay in the weeds, we are going to accomplish some things that will affect the next",
